 <p>Illustrative replicated participants. A1–A3 copy A’s data; B1–B3 copy B’s. The boxes are roles, not a claim about six physical machines, regions or a particular engine’s configuration. Per-participant agreement can preserve a prepared record without deciding the whole purchase.</p>
